OL,4,G0000FIn Their Own Words: Little Simz
OL,5,     GHighlights of Little Simz's
OL,6,     Gappearances on the BBC, including
OL,7,     Ginterviews and sessions.
OL,8,G0100FLittle Simz
OL,9,     GAnother chance to hear Little
OL,10,     GSimz from when she took over the
OL,11,     Gairwaves as part of 6 Music's
OL,12,     GWise Women Season. Expect cuts
OL,13,     Gfrom Childish Gambino, Kelis and
OL,14,     GFela Kuti.
OL,15,G0300FLittle Simz Live
OL,16,     GLittle Simz's best live
OL,17,     Gperformances from the BBC Archive
OL,18,     Gas part of her Artist Collection.
OL,19,     GIncluding early Radio 1 sessions
OL,20,     Gfrom 2014 and her appearance at
OL,21,     Gthe 6Music Festival 2019.
